@ far
# The cumulus standing over Bogachiel's summit, drawn first so the peak
# stands in front of it: a Sierra cloud, flat-shaded, its top a run of
# rounded puffs, each with its own clean edge, the tallest over the
# summit; a glacier-blue (3) shade under the puffs, and a flat base, a
# checker of snow and glacier blue (its two rows go in as paper cream, 5,
# for the checker to take), standing clear of the crest with sky between
# them.
